                <pb facs="0244" n="754" xml:id="pg754"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>Offices of the Department prepared two further draft trusteeship agreements for
                    Palestine on March 22 and 23; regarding the earlier drafts of February 11 and
                    12, see footnote 2, <ref target="#pg697">page 697</ref>. The draft of March 22
                    proposed that France, the United Kingdom, and the United States serve as
                    administering authority; the draft of the following day designated the United
                    Nations for this role. Both drafts are filed under 501.BB Palestine/3–2248; the
                    authors are not identified.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
